# Trivy allowlist.
#
# One entry per line: the CVE id, then a comment giving the date it was accepted
# and the reason. An entry with no dated reason is not allowed. Nothing is
# silenced here because it is inconvenient, only because there is no upstream
# fix or because the vulnerable path is provably unreachable.
#
# Review every entry when the dependency it covers is next upgraded.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-0000-00000  # 2026-01-01 no fixed version published upstream, <package> is build-only
